      <chord name="Bb"/>and <chord name="Bb"/>talks <chord name="Eb"/>with me<br/>
      <chord name="Ab"/>along <chord name="Ab7"/>life&#x27;s <chord name="Db"/>narrow <chord name="Ab"/>way.<br/>
      <chord name="Eb7"/>He <chord name="Ab"/>lives, <chord name="Bb7"/>He <chord name="Eb7"/>lives,<br/>
      <chord name="Ab"/><chord name="Ab7"/>salvation <chord name="Db"/>to <chord name="C"/>impart!<br/>
      <chord name="F7"/>You <chord name="Bb7"/>ask me <chord name="Ab"/>how <chord name="Eb7"/>I know <chord name="Ab"/>He lives?<br/>
      He lives within my heart.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      In all the world around me<br/>
      <chord name="Ab"/>I <chord name="C7"/>see <chord name="Fm"/>His <chord name="Bb"/>loving <chord name="Eb7"/>care,<br/>
