      <chord name="Eb7"/>thru <chord name="Ab"/>all <chord name="Bb7"/>the <chord name="Eb7"/>stormy blast,<br/>
      <chord name="Ab"/>The <chord name="Ab7"/>day <chord name="Db"/>of <chord name="C"/>His appearing<br/>
      <chord name="F7"/><chord name="Bb7"/>will <chord name="Ab"/>come <chord name="Eb7"/>at <chord name="Ab"/>last.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v3">
      <lines>
      Rejoice, rejoice, O Christian,<br/>
      <chord name="Ab"/>lift <chord name="C7"/>up <chord name="Fm"/>your <chord name="Bb"/>voice <chord name="Eb7"/>and sing,<br/>
      Eternal hallelujahs<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>to <chord name="Bb"/>Jesus Christ <chord name="Eb"/>the King!<br/>
      <chord name="Ab"/>The <chord name="Ab7"/>hope of <chord name="Db"/>all who <chord name="Ab"/>seek Him,<br/>
